# Keep line endings LF in the working tree, whatever the platform.
#
# Why this matters here: the repo root is also the deployed asset directory, and
# the app's parsers are line-based. With core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default)
# every checkout rewrote daily/tasks/tasks.md and friends to CRLF, and patterns
# like /^- \[( |x)\] (.+)$/ stop matching because `.` never matches \r — the
# tasks page silently showed zero tasks. The parsers now normalise CRLF too, but
# LF on disk keeps the served assets and GitHub Actions identical to local.
* text=auto eol=lf
